# IBM Carbon Design System Integration Skill

## Description
This skill provides comprehensive guidance for implementing IBM Carbon Design System components and patterns in the IBM Dexter AI Code Reviewer project. It covers Carbon React components, theming, accessibility, and enterprise-grade UI patterns specific to code review and analytics interfaces.

## Carbon Design System Overview
IBM Carbon Design System is IBM's open-source design system for digital products and experiences. It provides a comprehensive set of guidelines, components, and tools for building consistent, accessible, and enterprise-grade user interfaces.

**Official Resources:**
- Carbon Design System: https://carbondesignsystem.com/
- Carbon React: https://react.carbondesignsystem.com/
- GitHub: https://github.com/carbon-design-system/carbon

